.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/codex-path-traceability.md:3:description: "Decision: Codex C-PREP-001 path-precision finding addressed — entrypoint doc must be cited as .claude/CLAUDE.md not CLAUDE.md."
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/codex-path-traceability.md:16:# Entrypoint doc must be cited as `.claude/CLAUDE.md`, not bare `CLAUDE.md`
.gobbi/projects/gobbi/features/project-memory/decisions/codex-path-traceability.md:20:A path-precision concern was raised against the readiness work: the entrypoint document was cited as `CLAUDE.md:60` when the correct path is `.claude/CLAUDE.md:60`. There is no root-level `CLAUDE.md` in this repository — the file lives under `.claude/`, so the bare-path citation would not resolve for a future reader.
